  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into thin wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. <br>• Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer and bake until tender, 25-30 mins.<br>• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion. Slice tomato into thin wedges. Roughly chop coriander. Drain sweetcorn. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319cd9848b9dac058ad2/step-b36db100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Grate carrot. Using a paper towel, squeeze out any excess moisture from carrot. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook onion until tender, 4-5 mins.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, corn, coriander, cooked onion, curry spice blend, Cheddar cheese, the stock powder, plain flour, egg, milk and a pinch of pepper (if it’s too wet, add more flour).</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319cd9848b9dac058ad2/step-7e099510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return pan to medium-high heat and add enough olive oil to coat the base.<br>• When oil is hot, cook heaped spoonfuls of fritter mixture in batches, flattening with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don’t flip too early!). You should get 3-4 fritters per person.<br>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319cd9848b9dac058ad2/step-c3457f20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce, brown sugar and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar.<br>• In a large bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and soy dressing. Season to taste with salt and pepper.<br>• Divide fritters, wedges and salad between plates.<br>• Serve with garlic aioli.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319cd9848b9dac058ad2/step-f7c3d930.jpeg"
    }
  ]
